# Intain Markets Knowledge Base — Repository Overview

This is a **GitBook-synced documentation repository** for the Intain Markets platform.
It is NOT a code repository — it contains only markdown articles, images, and configuration.

## Architecture

```
IntainMarketsArticles/
├── .gitbook.yaml              # GitBook space config
├── .cursor/rules/             # AI agent rules (this directory)
├── SUMMARY.md                 # Navigation / table of contents (GitBook reads this)
├── README.md                  # Homepage (GitBook-managed)
├── AGENTS.md                  # Agent instructions
├── ARTICLE_TAXONOMY.md        # Article → Document Type mapping
├── SCREENSHOT_TRACKING.md     # Screenshot audit tracker
├── images/                    # All images, organized by article
│   └── {NN}-{kebab-title}/   # e.g., images/36-settlement-and-nft-transfer/
├── 01_*.md through 87_*.md    # Article files (sequential)
└── Intain Markets – *.xlsx    # Category taxonomy spreadsheet
```

## Platform Context

- **Product:** Intain Markets — structured finance platform
- **Product Lines:** Asset Sale (WLS), Credit Facilities, Securitization, Participation Agreements
- **Roles:** Issuer, Investor, Market Maker, Servicer, Paying Agent, Verification Agent, Admin
- **Backend:** Node.js (intain-markets-node-app)
- **UI:** React + Ant Design (intain-markets-ui)
- **Blockchain:** Avalanche L1 subnet (NFTs), Ethereum/Avalanche C-Chain (USDC settlement)

## Key Relationships

- `SUMMARY.md` drives GitBook sidebar → must match article files
- `ARTICLE_TAXONOMY.md` maps each article number to its Document Type
- `.cursor/rules/01-article-writing.mdc` defines the 12 document type structures (A–L)
- Every article has a corresponding `images/{NN}-{kebab}/` folder
